{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the regional line &quot;Shuppatsu-eki - Densha Terminal&quot;!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chill Train - Densha No Kuni is a small arcade/simulation train game with simple controls that puts you in the role of a driver on a fictional line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each journey is evaluated, and achieving an &quot;S&quot; rank on every route will require great precision and focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve the various stops at the scheduled times and handle the many events that arise during the journey, such as speed restrictions, level crossings, or unexpected maintenance work, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 base routes await to test your driving skills, with varying numbers of stops and different weather conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But with a bit of perseverance, you might unlock the brand-new high-speed &quot;Inazuma&quot; train and its dedicated routes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you soon on the &quot;Shuppatsu-eki &gt; Densha Terminal&quot; line!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743620?t=1747247720","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743620?t=1747247720","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743620/2aa3d8670b72a6c1d33442e31d8701687f320ea6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747247720","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743620/2aa3d8670b72a6c1d33442e31d8701687f320ea6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747247720","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the regional line &quot;Shuppatsu-eki - Densha Terminal&quot;!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chill Train - Densha No Kuni is a small arcade/simulation train game with simple controls that puts you in the role of a driver on a fictional line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each journey is evaluated, and achieving an &quot;S&quot; rank on every route will require great precision and focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve the various stops at the scheduled times and handle the many events that arise during the journey, such as speed restrictions, level crossings, or unexpected maintenance work, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 base routes await to test your driving skills, with varying numbers of stops and different weather conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But with a bit of perseverance, you might unlock the brand-new high-speed &quot;Inazuma&quot; train and its dedicated routes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you soon on the &quot;Shuppatsu-eki &gt; Densha Terminal&quot; line!</p>","developers":["Judox Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743620/d251a60a99d4ed5794871071d011ff592183b4aa/header.jpg?t=1747247720","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257139220,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139220/movie480.mp4?t=1747247518","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139220/movie_max.mp4?t=1747247518"},"name":"Chill Train - Gameplay